{"page":463,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:41","surah":39,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ لِلنَّاسِ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ فَمَنِ ٱهْتَدَىٰ فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن ضَلَّ فَإِنَّمَا يَضِلُّ عَلَيْهَا ۖ وَمَآ أَنتَ عَلَيْهِم بِوَكِيلٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent the Scripture down to you [Prophet] with the Truth for people. Whoever follows the guidance does so for his own benefit, whoever strays away from it does so at his own peril: you are not in charge of them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for [the] mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَنِ","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"famani","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","en_gloss":"accepts guidance","transliteration":"ih'tadā","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"then (it is) for his soul","transliteration":"falinafsihi","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ضَلَّ","en_gloss":"goes astray","transliteration":"ḍalla","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَضِلُّ","en_gloss":"he strays","transliteration":"yaḍillu","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"against his (soul)","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"39:41"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","v